# Form Builder

A powerful form builder that automatically generates forms from a JSON-like field configuration, integrated with `useForm` and Standard Schema (Valibot, Zod, etc.) for validation.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/form-builder.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/form-builder.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/form-builder.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { FormBuilder, useForm } from '@/registry/form-builder'
import { object, string, email, pipe } from 'valibot'

const schema = object({
  email: pipe(string(), email()),
  message: string()
})

const form = useForm(schema, {
  initialValues: { email: '', message: '' },
  onSubmit: (data) => console.log(data)
})

const fields = [
  { name: 'email', type: 'email', label: 'Email', placeholder: 'your@email.com' },
  { name: 'message', type: 'textarea', label: 'Message', placeholder: 'Your message...' }
]
</script>

<template>
  <FormBuilder :form="form" :fields="fields" />
</template>
```

