### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `fields` | `Field[]` | `undefined` | Array of field configurations. |
| `form` | `FormContext` | `undefined` | The form context returned by `useForm`. |
| `formClass` | `string` | `undefined` | CSS classes for the form element. |
| `isNested` | `boolean` | `false` | Whether the form is nested (used for fieldsets). |

### Supported Field Types

`text`, `email`, `password`, `textarea`, `select`, `async-select`, `checkbox`, `switch`, `number-field`, `numeric`, `currency`, `tel`, `url`, `slider`, `file`, `radio-group`, `date`, `custom`, `fieldset`.
